w40k-cmd-battle-tactic-siege-protocol-summary = Breakthrough pressure on contested sectors.
w40k-cmd-battle-tactic-siege-protocol-description = Aggressive pacing doctrine for offensive pushes and continuous stress on enemy relay points.
w40k-cmd-battle-tactic-machine-cult-name = Machine Cult Dogma
